      "comment": "PAT BRIAN (7) is a Warren Nicholls-trained newcomer by Aston Rupee out of Shy Shin. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Lot to like about his profile and expected to run well. OVERSHADOW GUNN (8) drifted back from wide but charged home to hit the frame when 1.5 lengths from the winner (20.45) at Capalaba in Maiden. Expecting another good run. PAW MACHAMP (1) held his own to the line last start and filled a minor placing, beaten only a nose (20.16) behind Mitts Whitaker at this track. Expecting another good run. SCUDERI ENZO (2) can sneak into the finish again.",
